{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_04_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_04","title":"苦夜惊雷","storyCode":"IS-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5bdbcc12c43fb6b1e1c71629c454bb13c778ce63d1ee673449254e442dbb9d12","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，好了没啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别催了啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，这衣服好紧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会偷偷背着我吃披萨吃胖了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能啦！只是昨天晚上多吃了一片而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空，吸气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞！完美！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了吗？快出来看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来了来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，好漂亮啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的，简直是完美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是德克萨斯那家伙也能看到就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不愧是空，这么快就能在叙拉古的舞台上获得演出机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《德克萨斯之死》这次采用了分幕演出的形式，第一幕已经顺利排练完成了，后天就要演出了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是顺利的话，说不定不是我去找她，反而变成她来找我了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能欸，我想想，到时候我一定要买个披萨拍她脸上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到德克萨斯，我最近也一直在打听贝洛内家族的事，这个家族最近的状况好像有点不太好，希望她没有受到什么影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙肯定没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，现在也只能相信她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空的舞台首秀之前，我们可以好好休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本还想在这座城市里多逛逛的，结果感觉我都成了空的贴身保镖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪我哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是剧场的免费伙食被我蹭了不少，嘿嘿，披萨味道真不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉之后也会变得更忙，我们去到处走走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你听......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的女演员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你说的是......德克......对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对，德克萨斯......判......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，请问你们刚才是不是提到了德克萨斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对啊，你也感兴趣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是听我贝洛内家族的男朋友说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"前几天建设部部长不是遇害了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"好像凶手已经被找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个德克萨斯家族最后的血脉，好像叫做什么切利尼娜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的女演员","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"开庭的日子也已经决定了，就在后天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂图索少爷，我们约好的这场会面，可被你拖了好几次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在抱歉，瓦拉赫先生，最近要我处理的事有些太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说你们让手下撤出了不少之前和其他家族有摩擦的地盘，正在担心你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你没事，我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一点止损罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我就喜欢你这种谨慎的性格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，罗塞蒂家对趁人之危不感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，有个问题，我不吐不快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必是德克萨斯的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“切利尼娜·德克萨斯”，她回来了，还是你的护卫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是她本人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我说是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们从来都不知道，她原来还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当年，是我父亲保下了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，原来如此，是他老人家的手笔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座新城市的建造，本来也是因萨尔瓦多雷与叙拉古的缘分而起，家父也只是希望她能够回到叙拉古看看这座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不愧是贝洛内家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明知德克萨斯这个姓氏对罗塞蒂家族来说意义重大，却就这样落落大方地请了回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大气，真的大气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我瓦拉赫今天算是服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在开玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩笑？这哪里是玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜小姐还活着的消息，对我们罗塞蒂来说意义非凡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管贝洛内怎么想，罗塞蒂都欠你们一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们两家是将来要共同建设新城市的关系，有什么欠与不欠的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好，说得好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，老弟你早就在这等着我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，你想要什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要的东西很简单——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗塞蒂不要插手这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？要我们眼睁睁地看着最后的德克萨斯被审判，我恐怕没有办法向首领交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到审判结束后，她会被收押，你们仍然可以见到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是见到她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱昂图索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是我们的客人，但她也可以是罗塞蒂的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，成交！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到，在这里把切利尼娜搬了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是拉维妮娅的想法吗？不......她不会不知道，切利尼娜不是凶手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以她的性格，她不会做出这个决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是莱昂说服了她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，无论如何，没想到还有这一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德米特里，现在，我们应该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要去暗杀切利尼娜吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道在七年前那场乱子里，有多少家族的精锐折在她手上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偷袭、爆炸，或者干脆下毒，或许我们总有些办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可别忘了，她归根结底是谁请回来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是谁的主意，这确实很聪明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，只能用一些粗暴的办法让审判中止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"归根结底，我们的目的是让城里乱起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从一开始，挑衅西西里夫人就在我们的计划之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，也只不过是把这一步提前了而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我倒觉得，还有别的方法哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普兰德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么有趣的事情，能让我也参加一下吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总监，德克萨斯的事情您知道了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是刚刚得知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道什么内幕吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少以我得到的消息来说，是拉维妮娅法官亲口宣布的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉维妮娅，是那位帮助过我的法官小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......不像是会说谎的人，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要推掉你的首秀吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......能帮我想一想办法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......至少先见一见她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"且不论你的首秀是否可以推迟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道的是，见到了又如何呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐，我还记得，你曾经说过，你是为了与她重逢才与另外两个朋友一起来到叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直相信着，你所见到的她，就是真正的她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，你已经知道，她隐藏的过去究竟如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你被迫发现，你所追逐的那个人，或许与你的想象相去甚远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见到她，又能怎么样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能对她说些什么，她又能对你说些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果真的是这样，那么恐怕，擅自想象的我也有责任，或许是我对她还不够了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是对方对你有所隐瞒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也要看对方有没有理由呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，贝纳尔多先生，在演艺圈这个大染缸里，我也算是见识过许多人啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要做到表里如一实在是太难了，至少我认为我是做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总是在想，有一天我也会变得身不由己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我从来都不会去要求别人这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每个人都会有秘密，我也有，她也有，想必，您也会有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果对方将他想要展现给我的一面贯彻到底，这难道不也是一种真诚吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......诚然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，或许是我那时候没有说清楚吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来找德克萨斯，不是想要责备她，不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们四个一起在龙门生活了快六年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这六年的生活对我来说是弥足珍贵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我至少相信，对她来说，也是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此，她却依然不告而别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该为此愤怒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我很担心她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使和可颂也是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们才会来到叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她被卷进了麻烦的事情里，那我们就去帮助她脱身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她的过去沉重到能够压垮她，那我们就去和她一起承担。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"众多剧作中，关于切利尼娜的末路虽然只是谣传，但德克萨斯家族的末路却是众所周知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的过去恐怕比你想象的要深重得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们没有亲口听到她这么告诉我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她必须亲口告诉我们，她的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这样，当我们努力的最后结果依然是她要离开，那时，我才能心甘情愿地和她告别呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我努力过了，我不后悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，大概还是会后悔吧，但不会那么后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很有智慧，空小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是给自己的逞强找点借口而已啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，和您这么说了一通之后，我也感觉好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，现在即使我真的能见她，恐怕什么也帮不了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，我都已经准备同意你的要求了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在审判之后，你会见到她的，我保证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在，可能还要再等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，在那之前，我会好好准备的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真遗憾，我不能亲眼看到你的首秀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？您不看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，那天，我恐怕会有一些重要的事情要处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你可以放心，我已经为你准备好了最好的舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"贝纳尔多走到书架边，从书架上抽出一本书。\n那是一本环绕着荆棘的法典。\n他沉默良久，最后，拨通一个电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝纳尔多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德米特，告诉她，就说，我答应了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“轰”的一声，窗外，雷声翻涌。\n像是在预告着，大雨将至。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
